<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">推送渠道</view>
    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label">Telegram</view>
      <view class="channel-line">
        <text class="channel-status {{tgBound ? 'ok' : 'muted'}}">{{tgBound ? "已绑定：" + tg : "未绑定"}}</text>
        <button wx:if="{{tgBound}}" class="btn-link" data-channel="telegram" bindtap="unbind">解绑</button>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label">飞书</view>
      <view class="channel-line">
        <text class="channel-status {{fsBound ? 'ok' : 'muted'}}">{{fsBound ? "已绑定（单聊会话已建立）" : (fsIncomplete ? "未完成：请先给机器人发消息" : "未绑定")}}</text>
        <button wx:if="{{fsOpen}}" class="btn-link" data-channel="feishu" bindtap="unbind">解绑</button>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="notice-line" style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:24rpx;line-height:1.8;margin-top:8rpx">
      给机器人发任意一条消息（如 /start），系统会自动记录会话；再用下方绑定码把渠道合并到当前账号。
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="form-label">新帖推送开关</view>
      <switch checked="{{notify}}" color="#1677ff" bindchange="onNotify" />
    </view>
    <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" bindtap="save">保存设置</button>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">账号绑定</view>
    <view class="notice-line" style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:24rpx;line-height:1.8">
      生成绑定码后，发给 Telegram / 飞书机器人（/bind 6位码），即可把该渠道绑到当前账号。
    </view>
    <view style="margin-top:20rpx">
      <button class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="genBindCode">生成绑定码</button>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{bindCode}}" class="bind-code-box">
      <view class="bind-code">{{bindCode}}</view>
      <view class="muted" style="font-size:24rpx;margin-top:8rpx">发给机器人：/bind {{bindCode}}（{{bindMinutes}} 分钟内有效）</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
